  "title": "Scale by a rounded power of two",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Scale by a rounded power of two",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The exact scalar signature is x:F64,n:F64 -> result:F64. With x=8, floating n rounds to the nearest even integer before scaling. The exponent's type remains F64; no implicit promotion or integer shift is claimed.\n\nThe exact scalar signature is x:F64,n:F64 -> result:F64. With x=8, floating n rounds to the nearest even integer before scaling. The exponent's type remains F64; no implicit promotion or integer shift is claimed.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.numeric.scale-power-two-even@1.\nExpected:\nresult (f64) = 2\n",
